{"version":1,"key":"quest:138","content":{"id":138,"title":"tabIndex 的使用","summary":"暂未记录答案","target":{"key":"quest:138","type":"quest","id":138},"groupId":2,"groupTitle":"前端","groupColor":"mint-green","status":"resolved","answers":[],"materials":[{"index":1,"kind":"card","group":"note","title":"tabIndex 取值规则与默认可聚焦元素","meta":"","excerpt":"tabIndex 是 HTML 的一个全局属性，它控制这个元素是否可以通过键盘 Tab 来聚焦元素，以及通过 Tab 键访问时的访问顺序。 通过 Tab 键按序访问下一个，通过 Shift + Tab 可以访问到上一个。 tabIndex 有三种取值： -1，不能通过 Tab 键聚焦，但是可以通过编程 .focus()","target":{"key":"card:691","type":"card","id":691},"citeKey":"card:691"}],"trail":[{"time":1768526525598,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1774865884944,"tone":"milestone","text":"写下卡片","refs":[1]},{"time":1774865884956,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]}],"description":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"createTime":1768526525598,"updateTime":1768526525598,"resolvedTime":1774865884956},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1768526525598}}